ERP, CRM, e-commerce, WhatsApp, financeiro e aplicativo conectados por uma camada de integração\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#111a2e] shadow-2xl shadow-black/30 p-5 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-3 text-xs text-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database size-5 text-slate-300\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg>ERP</div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-3 text-xs text-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users size-5 text-slate-300\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>CRM</div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-3 text-xs text-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-cart size-5 text-slate-300\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M2.05 2.05h2l2.66 12.42a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.58h9.78a2 2 0 0 0 1.95-1.57l1.65-7.43H5.12\"></path></svg>E-commerce</div><div class=\"col-span-3 flex justify-around\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"h-6 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-brand-cyan/60\"></span><span class=\"h-6 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-brand-cyan/60\"></span><span class=\"h-6 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-brand-cyan/60\"></span></div><div class=\"col-span-3 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-md border border-brand-cyan/40 bg-brand-cyan/10 px-4 py-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plug size-5 text-brand-cyan\"><path d=\"M12 22v-5\"></path><path d=\"M9 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M15 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M18 8v5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8Z\"></path></svg><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Camada de integração</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-sky-100/70\">APIs · webhooks · filas</p></div></div><div class=\"col-span-3 flex justify-around\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"h-6 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-cyan/60 to-white/10\"></span><span class=\"h-6 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-cyan/60 to-white/10\"></span><span class=\"h-6 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-cyan/60 to-white/10\"></span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-3 text-xs text-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle size-5 text-slate-300\"><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg>WhatsApp</div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-3 text-xs text-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet size-5 text-slate-300\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4\"></path></svg>Financeiro</div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-3 text-xs text-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone size-5 text-slate-300\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg>Aplicativo</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">O ponto de partida</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Quando a integração resolve</h2></div><ul class=\"grid gap-x-8 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Pedidos da loja virtual são digitados de novo no ERP</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">O financeiro não enxerga o que o comercial vendeu</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Dados de clientes divergem entre sistemas</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">A equipe usa cinco ferramentas que não se falam</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Um parceiro precisa receber ou enviar dados automaticamente</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">O aplicativo precisa consultar o sistema principal em tempo real</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">O que entregamos</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Integrações e APIs: o que podemos construir.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-200 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">ERP, CRM e e-commerce</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Pedidos, clientes, estoque e preços sincronizados entre as plataformas.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Gateways de pagamento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Confirmação de pagamento recebida automaticamente por webhook e refletida no sistema.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">WhatsApp</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Envio e recebimento de mensagens integrados ao sistema, com status de entrega e histórico por cliente.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">APIs para aplicativos e parceiros</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Criação de APIs seguras para que aplicativos, parceiros e outros sistemas consumam seus dados.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Bancos de dados e sistemas próprios</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Leitura e escrita em bases existentes, inclusive de sistemas legados.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Serviços de terceiros</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Consumo de APIs externas — pagamentos, comunicação, logística — com tratamento de falhas e registro.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Para a empresa</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">O que muda na prática.</h2></div><ul class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Informação registrada uma única vez</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Menos redigitação entre sistemas</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Dados consistentes em todas as áreas</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Base pronta para novos canais e aplicativos</li></ul></div><div class=\"grid content-start gap-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">Exemplos de como a informação passa a circular:</p><figure class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6\"><figcaption class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">Operação conectada</figcaption><ol class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 md:flex-row md:flex-wrap md:items-center\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">ERP</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Sistema</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Aplicativo</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">WhatsApp</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Financeiro</span></li></ol></figure><figure class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6\"><figcaption class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">Do site à venda</figcaption><ol class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 md:flex-row md:flex-wrap md:items-center\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Site</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Lead</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">CRM</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Automação</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Vendedor</span></li></ol></figure></div></div></section><section id=\"como-funciona\" class=\"scroll-mt-20 bg-brand-navy py-20 text-white sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-cyan\">Como funciona</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-white\">Primeiro entendemos o processo. Depois desenvolvemos a solução.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><ol class=\"grid gap-x-6 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-6\"><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">01</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Entendimento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Entendemos o processo, as pessoas envolvidas e o problema a resolver.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">02</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Planejamento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Definimos solução, arquitetura, prioridades e etapas de entrega.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">03</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Desenvolvimento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Construímos em etapas, com validação a cada entrega.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">04</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Integração</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Conectamos os sistemas e ferramentas que a operação já usa.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">05</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Implantação</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Colocamos em produção, migramos dados e preparamos a equipe.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">06</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Evolução</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Mantemos, acompanhamos e melhoramos continuamente.</p></li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr]\"><div><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Perguntas frequentes</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Dúvidas comuns.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200\"><div data-state=\"open\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_cne_\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-state=\"open\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Meu sistema atual pode ser integrado?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform rotate-180\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"open\" id=\"radix-_R_cne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Se ele tiver API, webhooks, acesso ao banco de dados ou exportação de arquivos, quase sempre sim. Avaliamos isso no diagnóstico, antes de qualquer proposta.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Vocês também criam APIs?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_kne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Sim. Desenvolvemos APIs REST autenticadas para aplicativos, parceiros e integrações entre sistemas próprios.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Integração é segura?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_sne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Usamos autenticação por token, comunicação por HTTPS, validação dos dados recebidos e registro das chamadas. Credenciais ficam somente no servidor.</div></div></div></div></div><aside><h2 class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">Soluções relacionadas</h2><ul class=\"mt-4 divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200\"><li><a class=\"group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4\" href=\"/automacao-de-processos\"><span><span class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-blue-hover\">Automação de processos</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Rotinas repetitivas executadas sozinhas: notificações, cobranças, follow-ups, documentos e movimentação de dados.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4\" href=\"/desenvolvimento-de-sistemas\"><span><span class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-blue-hover\">Sistemas sob medida</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Software construído em cima do processo real da empresa, quando uma ferramenta pronta não atende.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4\" href=\"/desenvolvimento-de-aplicativos\"><span><span class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-blue-hover\">Aplicativos</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Aplicativos Android e iOS para clientes, equipes de campo e operações internas, integrados aos seus sistemas.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></aside></div></section><section id=\"orcamento\" class=\"scroll-mt-16 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:grid-rows-[auto_1fr] lg:gap-x-20\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Orçamento</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Solicite um orçamento: integrações e apis.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-7 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8 text-slate-600\">Conte o que precisa ser resolvido. Respondemos com perguntas objetivas e os próximos passos, sem compromisso.</p></div><div class=\"relative rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-8 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-span-2 lg:row-start-1\"><form class=\"grid gap-5\" action=\"/contato\" method=\"post\"><noscript>O envio do formulário precisa de JavaScript. Se preferir, escreva para <!-- -->__AB_EMAIL__<!-- -->.</noscript><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"grid content-start gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leading-none font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50\" for=\"_R_18e_-contact_name\">Nome</label><input data-slot=\"input\" class=\"border-input file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:b