unded-md border bg-white px-3 text-base text-slate-900 shadow-xs outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 h-11\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\">Selecione uma opção</option></select></div><div class=\"grid gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leading-none font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50\" for=\"_R_18e_-notes\">Descrição da necessidade</label><textarea id=\"_R_18e_-notes\" name=\"notes\" required=\"\" rows=\"5\" maxLength=\"5000\" placeholder=\"Quais sistemas precisam trocar dados, que informação deve circular e em que direção.\" class=\"border-input flex w-full rounded-md border bg-white px-3 text-base text-slate-900 shadow-xs outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 py-2.5 placeholder:text-slate-500\"></textarea></div><div class=\"absolute -left-[9999px] opacity-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"_R_18e_-website_hp\">Deixe este campo em branco</label><input id=\"_R_18e_-website_hp\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autoComplete=\"off\" name=\"website_hp\"/></div><label class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 accent-brand-blue\" name=\"marketing_consent\" value=\"1\"/>Aceito receber conteúdos e novidades da ABrasil Sistemas (opcional).</label><p class=\"text-xs leading-5 text-slate-600\">Informe ao menos um e-mail ou telefone. Usamos seus dados para responder a este contato, conforme a<!-- --> <a href=\"/politica-de-privacidade\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">Política de Privacidade</a>.</p><button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-brand-blue px-6 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-brand-blue-hover focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-b